Package: lenovo-elden-sensors
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Local build <root@localhost>
Depends: iio-sensor-proxy, libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.76), libqmi-glib5 (>= 1.34), libqrtr-glib0, libprotobuf-c1, libgudev-1.0-0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, libc6
Description: Lenovo Y700 Gen4 SSC sensor support
 Includes private libraries and runtime data. Board services are installed separately.
 .
 The distribution iio-sensor-proxy package supplies the systemd service,
 D-Bus configuration and permission policies. Armbian supplies a systemd
 drop-in that selects the private binary and libraries under
 /usr/share/lenovo-elden-sensors. The distribution binary is not overwritten.
